'''Combinations''',<ref>[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]</ref><ref name="DATR"/> also known as '''Combos''',<ref>[[Heat Jaws]]</ref><ref name="DATR" /> are a [[Transformation Gimmicks|transformation gimmick]] that was introduced in the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]'''. These transformations are hybrids of two alien species.

==Concept==
Combinations are a hybrids of the DNA samples of two different species. Their appearance feature aspects of both, and the transformation can use the powers and abilities of both species at the same time, allowing a whole new combat opportunity.

They were originally an unintentional effect [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] discovered when he transformed with the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] without its faceplate. [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] later made them into the main feature of the [[Biomnitrix]].

==Activation==
===Original Omnitrix===
While the Omnitrix faceplate was missing, Ben would transform into combo aliens created randomly by the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]]. All of the combinations are either incompatible with each other or made the aliens' original abilities considerably weaker. In addition, energy and DNA left inside the detached faceplate could also hybridise nearby creatures, creating hybrids such as [[Max's Lepidopterran Mutation]] or [[Heatbat]].

===Biomnitrix===
The Biomnitrix is two Omnitrices that are linked together, thus allowing the user to perform alien combinations by slamming the two gauntlets together. [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] is able to choose which aliens he combines together.

==History==
===Ben 10===
Alien combinations were introduced in ''[[Dr. Animo and the Mutant Ray]]'', where [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] unintentionally unlocked the feature by fiddling with the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] and removing its faceplate with an screwdriver. Without its faceplate, rather than transforming the user into a different species, the Omnitrix and the faceplate were fusing the DNAs of the hosts with other DNA samples. After gaining the faceplate back from [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]] and fixing the Omnitrix, Ben lost access to the combinations feature.

===Future===
Years after rediscovering his childhood happiness of being a hero when [[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|he met]] his [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|10-year-old self]],{{Refn|[[:File:DJW came up with Biomnitrix.png]]|name = idea|group = DJW}} [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] developed the Biomnitrix,{{Refn|[[:File:Biomnitrix Name Reveal.png]]|group = DJW|name = Dev}} with the help of his smartest aliens,{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 10,000 Smartest aliens.PNG]]|group = DJW}} and reunlocked the feature once he used during [[Dr. Animo and the Mutant Ray|one of his old adventures]].

